## 💡 Executive Summary & Core Mission

Healthcare access in underserved and rural areas often suffers from delays in emergency triage, language barriers, and fragmented patient records. **SAATHI 2.0** bridges this gap by turning any smartphone into an intelligent, multi-user digital health companion capable of:
- Performing non-invasive vitals estimations (rPPG/PPG heart rate & oxygen).
- Running rule-based & AI-driven emergency symptom triage.
- Analyzing physical paper lab reports via client-side OCR and Groq LLM.
- Maintaining segregated electronic health records for entire families.
- Operating offline seamlessly in low-connectivity environments.

